# Milestone-2 integration (X7): the commit box's AI control in the middle of a generation (the button reads "Stop"
# with a spinner and the message field is read-only) and after it, against the fake local provider streaming one
# word every 400 ms. Dark theme, 1280x720; compare with 21 section 5.3.
resize 1280x720
set theme dark
ai use fake provider 400
open repository linear
wait idle
ai prepare staged changes
wait idle
ai set message wip: sign-up form
ai generate
wait 2500
shot x7-ai-01-streaming-stop
wait idle
shot x7-ai-02-generated
assert no error
